{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30645","headline":"和陕州参军李通微首夏书怀呈同寮张裳段羣二先辈 · 姚鹄","name":"和陕州参军李通微首夏书怀呈同寮张裳段羣二先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公门何事更相牵，邵伯优贤任养闲。\n满院落花从覆地，半檐初日未开关。\n寻仙郑谷烟霞里，避暑柯亭树石间。\n独爲高怀谁和继，掾曹同处桂同攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30645.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30645","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}